---
// biome-ignore-all lint/suspicious/noUnknownAttribute: Astro templates use native HTML attributes.
type Props = Record<string, never>;
---

<div class="page-shell">
  <section aria-labelledby="process-title" class="process">
    <div class="process-head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">04 / How we work</p>
        <h2 id="process-title">Less theatre.<br>More working together.</h2>
      </div>
      <p>
        You work directly with the people doing the work. No pitch team that
        disappears. No layers of account management. Just a clear process and
        honest conversations.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="process-grid">
      <article class="process-step">
        <div class="process-step-head">
          <span>01</span><span>Understand</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Get close.</h3>
        <p>
          We talk to your team, your customers and the people who haven’t chosen
          you. We read the technical documents, too.
        </p>
        <small>A shared understanding of the problem.</small>
      </article>
      <article class="process-step">
        <div class="process-step-head">
          <span>02</span><span>Define</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Make a choice.</h3>
        <p>
          We find the strongest, most credible position you can own. Then agree
          on a clear direction before designing anything.
        </p>
        <small>A position everyone can get behind.</small>
      </article>
      <article class="process-step">
        <div class="process-step-head">
          <span>03</span><span>Design & build</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Make it real.</h3>
        <p>
          Strategy becomes language, identity and digital experience. We share
          work early, test the important things and refine together.
        </p>
        <small>A coherent, working brand system.</small>
      </article>
      <article class="process-step">
        <div class="process-step-head">
          <span>04</span><span>Equip & launch</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Make it last.</h3>
        <p>
          We leave your team with the tools, training and documentation to do
          good work without us. And stay close when you need us.
        </p>
        <small>A confident launch. A capable team.</small>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
